<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Tonga Kubumbulula Mulimu</book>
  <para style="h">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lugwalo Lutaanzi Lwakalembwa aPita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lugwalo Lutaanzi Lwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">PITA</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Lugwalo lutaanzi lwaPita </char> lwakalembwa amutumwa Pita. Pita wakatanguna lugwalo lwakwe akulilungununa mwini mpawo akulungununa ooko nkulwakali kuya. Wakalembela banaKkirisitu boonse (beenzu munyika eeyi) (1 Pita 1:1,17; 2:11). Wakali kululamika kuli basikubala bakwe twiingi nkaambo bakali senseene munyika zisiyenesiyene. Nkaambo lugwalo oolu lutondeezya lugwalo lwaPawulu kuli BaEfeso mulizimwi nzila, bayingi basyoma kuti lugwalo lutaanzi lwaPita lwakalembwa nikwakamana kulembwa lugwalo lwaBaEfesu mumunyaka wamakumi alimusanu akkumi limwi alaa minyaka ilimusanu Jesu kaali wazyalwa. Pita wakalemba lugwalo oolu kuRoma eeyo njakati niBbabbiloni (1 Pita 5:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pita waamba kuti lugwalo oolu wakalulembela kuti, “Amusungwazye akumupa bukamboni kuti oolu nduuluzyalo lwaLeza lwakasimpe” (1 Pita 5:12). Kuli kukozyana kwiingi akati ka (1 Pita 2:11—3:7, BaEfeso 5:18—6:9, BaKkolose 3:18—4:6). Zipanzi eezi zyoonse zitatu zitupa malayilile atala ampuli mbiijisi bulidilano alimwi akulemeka beendelezi. Alubo usungwazya banaKkirisitu kuti bakakatile muchiindi nikwaba mapenzi nkaambo mamanino ali afwiifwi (1 Pita 4:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime</para>
  <para style="io1">Pita ulalipandulula mwini alimwi waambila basikubala balugwalo bakwe (1 Pita 1:1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo ulumba Leza ankaambo kalufutuko oolo ndubaabilana boonse alimwi kuti lwaambaanzi oolu mubuumi bwabo (1 Pita 1:3—2:10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chitobela ulayilila basyomi kuti bapone kabotu munyika alimwi akuba abulidilano busiyenesiyene buli mbuli akati kamwaalumi amwanakazi mpawo amuzike asimalelo wakwe (1 Pita 2:11—4:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kunembo azeezyo Pita ulabasungwazya kuti bakakatile muchiindi nibaba amapenzi (1 Pita 4:12—5:11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo umanisya lugwalo lwakwe (1 Pita 5:12-14)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Ndime Pita, mutumwa waJesu Kkirisitu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Kuli banakweenda bamuSanseene muzilikiti zyaPontasi, Galatiya, Kkapadosiya, Eziya akuBbitiniya, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />basalidwe akubikkwa aLeza Taata alimwi bakasalazigwa aMuuya kuti balemeke Jesu Kkirisitu alimwi nkaambo kakunsansiilwa abulowa bwakwe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Luzyalo aluumuno ngaluvule kulindinywe.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulangilizi Bupona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ngalumbwe Leza aWisi waMwami wesu Jesu Kkirisitu! Aluse lwakwe lupati twakazyalwa bupya kubulangilizi bwakupona mukwiinda mukubuka kwaJesu Kkirisitu kuzwa kubafu, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />alimwi mulukono lutanyonyooki pe, lutakwe kampenda, alimwi lutakulumpali pe, lubambilidilwe ndinywe kujulu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />inywe nimukwabilidwe mukwiinda munguzu zyaLeza mukwiinda mulusyomo nkaambo kalufutuko luyubunidwe kale kuchiindi chakumamanino.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Muli cheechi amubotelwe, nikuba lino muchiindi chiniini mweelede kuyopenzegwa mumasukuusyo asiyenesiyene, <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />kuchitila kuti lusyomo lwanu lwachoonzyo, lubotu kwiinda ingolide oolo nikuba lulaloba lulayeezyegwa amulilo, lulaliboniya mukutembawula amubulemu akululemeko kukuyubununwa kwaJesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Kamutamubwene pe, mulamuyanda, nikuba kuti lino tamumubwenye mulasyoma mulinguwe alimwi mulabotelwa kutaambiki alukondo lusumpukide, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />nkaambo mujana mpindu yalusyomo lwanu oolo luli lufutuko lwamyuuya yanu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Atala alufutuko oolu basinsimi bakasinsima atala aluzyalo oolo lweelede kuba lwanu bakafunkulula akuyanduulisisya, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />bakayanduulisisya kuti muntu uli biyeni nikuba kuti nchiindinzi eecho chakaambwa aMuuya waKkirisitu mulimbabo nibakali kwaamba atala akupenzegwa kwaKkirisitu abulemu oobo bwakali kutobela. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Chakayubununwa kulimbabo kuti teebakali kulikutawukila lwabo pesi inywe, muzintu zyakaambwa kulindinywe abaabo bakakambawuka makani mabotu kulindinywe mukwiinda muMuuya Usalala wakatumwa kuzwa kujulu, zintu eezyo baangelo zibalangilila.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwiito Lwakupona Mubusalali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Nkikaako ngamuchenjele kumizeezo yanu, mululame, amubikke bulangilizi bwanu buzwide atala aluzyalo oolo luchiza kulindinywe kukuyubununwa kwaJesu Kkirisitu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Mbuli bana baswiilila, mutaponi muziyandisyo zyanu zyabubi zyakale eezyo zyakutaziba Leza, <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />pesi mbuli ooyo wakamwiita ulasalala, amusalale anywebo mukuchita kwanu koonse, <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />mbuli kuti kulilembedwe kuti, “Amusalale, nkaambo ime ndilasalala.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Alimwi kuti nimukomba kamumwiita kuti nguTaata ooyo ubeteka umwi awumwi chakutasaluuzya mukwiinda munchito zyakwe, ngamupone chakuyoowa chiindi choonse banakweenda munyika. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Mulizi kuti mwakanununwa kuzwa munzila zibi nzimwakakona kuzwa kuli bamawuso, peepe azintu zibola zilimbuli insiliva angolide, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />pesi abulowa buyandisi bwaKkirisitu, buli mbuli oobo bwanwana wambelele butakwe kampenda nikuba kabata. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Wakabikkwa kale nyika kiitanalengwa pesi wakayubununwa kumamanino achiindi nkaambo kanu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Mukwiinda mulinguwe mujisi busichaamba muli Leza, wakamubusya kuzwa kubafu mpawo wamupa bulemu, kuchitila kuti lusyomo lwanu abulangizi bube muli Leza.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Kamuli mwakasalazya myuuya akuswiilizya kwanu kukasimpe nkaambo kaluyando lwabakwesu lwachoonzyo, ngamuyandane chakumaninina kuzwa kumoyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Mwakazyalwa bupya, peepe ambuto ibola pesi eeyo itaboli, mukwiinda mujwi lipona akukkalilila lyaLeza, <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />nkaambo malembe aamba kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Bantu boonse balimbuli sokwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">alimwi bulemu bwalyo buli mbuli malubaluba asokwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Sokwe lilayuma, mpawo malubaluba alaloka,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />pesi ijwi lyaMwami lilakkalilila kwalyoonse.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ijwi eeli ngiimakani mabotu akakambawukwa kulindinywe.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Ibbwe Lipona aNyika Isalali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Aboobo ngamusowe zyoonse zisofweede akoonse kweena akuwupawupa abbivwe akuvwiya koonse. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Mbuli bana bavwanda, amuyandisye makupa achoonzyo amuuya, kuti angawo mukakomene mulufutuko, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Nkaambo mwakalabila kale bubotu bwaMwami.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Ngamuze kulinguwe, kuli ooyo musemo upona, wakakakwa abantu pesi kubusyu bwaLeza wakasalwa alimwi muyandisi, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />alimwi mbuli misemo ipona amuyakwe kuti mube ŋanda yaMuuya, mukabe mbuli nkamu yabapayizi basalala, mukape zipayizyo zyamuuya zitambulika kuli Leza mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />mbuli mbukubede mumalembe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Amulange! Ndabikka musemo muZiyoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">musemo waŋanda usalidwe alimwi muyandisi loko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">mpawo ooyo usyoma mulinguwe takoyoofwisigwa bweme pe.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nkikaako kulindinywe nimusyoma, muyandisi, pesi kulibaabo batasyomi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Chiyako eecho bayaki nchibakakaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">chaba musemo mupati muyandisyi waŋanda,”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />alimwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Chiyako eecho chiyoochita bantu kuti bakalebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">musemo eecho chiyoochita bantu kuti bakawe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Balalebwa nkaambo kakutalemeka ijwi, mbuli mbubakali bambilidwe kuti bachite.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Pesi mulimusyobo usalidwe, bapayizi babwami, muli nyika isalala, bantu baLeza, kuti mukaluule milimu igambya yayooyo wakamwiita kuzwa mumudima kuya mumumuni wakwe ugambya. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Muchiindi chayinda teemwakali bantu baLeza pe, pesi lino muli bantu baLeza, chiindi chakayinda teemwakali tambwide luse pe pesi lino mwatambula luse.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bazike BaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Nimuyandwa, ndamusungwaazya mbuli beenzu abanakweenda munyika eeyi kuzwa kuzisusi zibi zyamubili eezyo zyeeta nkondo kumuuya wanu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Ngamupone munzila ilikabotu akati kabaabo batazi Leza, kuchitila kuti ambweni ngabalaambula bubi atala andinywe, ambweni ngabalabona milimu yanu mibotu mpawo bakalumbayizye Leza mubuzuba oobo mbwayoliboniya.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Amulibombye nkaambo kaMwami kumuntu woonse uli mubweendelezi bwabantu, nikuba kumwaami wachisi, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />nikuba kubeendelezi mbakasala mbuli batumidwe anguwe kukupa chisubulo kulibaabo babisya akulumbayizya aabo bachita kabotu. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Nkaambo nkuukuyanda kwaLeza, kuti mukuchita kabotu mukawumuzye bantu bafubafuba batazi. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Ngamupone mbuli bantu baangunukide, pesi mutabelesyi kwaangunuka kwanu kukuvumba bubi, pesi ngamupone mbuli balanda baLeza. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mulemeke bantu boonse. Muyande babunyokwe. Muyoowe Leza. Mulemeke mwami.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyanisyo Wakupenzegwa KwaKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Inywe nibalanda, ngamulifwiinsye kulibasimalelo banu alulemeko loonse, peepe luzutu kuli bali abuuya abali amoyo mubombe, pesi alubo aabo bali abukali. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Nkaambo umwi ulalumbwa kuti, kabikkide mizeezo yakwe kuli Leza, ulakakatila kumachise nikuba napenzegwa zitaluleme. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Nkaambo ujana mpinduunzi kuti, wachita chibi mpawo wawumwa ankaambo kanchicho kukakatide? Pesi kuti wachita chibotu mpawo wapenzegwa ankaambo kanchicho kukakatide, ulijisi kulumbilizigwa aLeza. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Nkaambo kuli cheechi mwakayitwa, mpawo Kkirisitu alakwe wakapenzegwa ankaambo kanu, kamusiila chikozyanisyo, kuti mutobele muntaamo zyakwe. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Tachitide chibi pe, taakwe manwa pe akajanwa mumulomo wakwe. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Eelyo nibakali kumutukila, taakwe naakabatukila pe mukubweedezya, naakapenzegwa taakwe naakabayosezya pe, pesi wakasyoma kuliyooyo ubeteka munzila iluleme. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />We lwakwe wakanyampula zibi zyesu mumubili wakwe achisamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wakanyampula zibi zyesu mumubili wakwe achiingano</char></note>, kuti tukafwe kuchibi mpawo tupone mubusalali. Azilonda zyakwe mwakaponesegwa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Nkaambo mwakalikusweeka mbuli mbelele, pesi lino mwabweeda kuMweembeli aSikulanga myuuya yanu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Balumi aBanakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Kulikozyene inywe nibanakazi, mulibombye kubalumi banu, kuchitila kuti bamwi baabo, nikuba kuti tabalemeki ijwi pe, ambweni ngabalayobolwa kakutakwe ijwi pe pesi abuumi bwabanakazi babo, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />nibabona chiimo chanu chabusalali akulizyotolola. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Lino bubotu bwanu butabi bwakunze akupesa masusu, nikuba kulipulapula azyangolide, alimwi akusama zisamo zyamuulo ulaatala, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />pesi ngakube muntu wamukati kamoyo andalila zitaboli zyamuuya mubombe amuuya wachuumunizi, ooyo muyandisi kubusyu bwaLeza. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Munzila njiyeeyi banakazi bakale aabo bakali basalali alimwi bakali abulangilizi muli Leza bakali kulipulapula alimwi bakali kulifwiinsya kubalumi babo, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />mbuli Sara mbwakalemeka Abburahamu, kamwiita kuti mwami. Alimwi lino muli bana bakwe kuti mwachita ziluleme mpawo kutabi chintu chimuyoosya.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Mbumbubo inywe nibalumi, mupone zyeelede abanakazi banu, mubape bulemu mbuli bakompeme, mbukunga mulijisini muluzyalo lwabuumi, kuchitila kuti inkombyo zyanu zitajalilwi.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupenzegwa Nkaambo Kakuchita Bululami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Kumamanino, moonse, ngamube amuyeeyo umwi, luse, luyando lwabunyina, amoyo mutete amuzeezo wakulifwiinsya. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Mutabweedezyi bubi kububi, nikuba lutuko kulutuko, pesi muli imwi inzila alubo ngamulongezye, nkaambo kuli cheechi nkumwakayitwa, kuti mukajane chilongezyo. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Nkaambo kulilembedwe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Ooyo uyanda buumi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">akubona mazuba mabotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ngalesye lulimi lwakwe kububi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">amulomo wakwe kukwaambuula zyakubeja,<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />ngaleke kuchita bubi, achite zibotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">ngayanduule luumuno mpawo alutobelezye.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Nkaambo meso aMwami ali kubaluleme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">alimwi matwi akwe alaswiilila kunkombyo zyabo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">Pesi busyu bwaMwami bufutatila aabo bachita bubi.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Lino ngwani unga ulamunyonyona kuti kamulipedelede nkaambo kanchicho chiluleme? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Nikuba kuti mwapenzegwa ankaambo kabusalali, muyoolongezegwa. Mutabayoowi eezyo nzibayoowa pe, nikuba kulikataazya atala ambabo, <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />pesi mumyoyo yanu ngamulemeke Kkirisitu mbuli Mwami. Mulibambile chiindi choonse kukulikwabilila kuli kufumbwa umwiita kuti mumwaambile nkaambo abulangilizi buli mulindinywe, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />alimwi ngamuchite amoyo mutete akupa bulemu. Amube amiyeeyo iluleme, kuchitila kuti, nimwatajatwa obotu, aabo batukila chiwa chanu chibotu muli Kkirisitu bafwisigwe bweeme. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Nkaambo kulimbubo kupenzegwa ankaambo kakuchita chiluleme, kuti kwaba kuyanda kwaLeza, kwiinda kuchita bubi. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Nkaambo alakwe Kkirisitu wakafwa nkaambo kazibi kamwi kwalyoonse, ululeme nkaambo kabataluleme, kuchitila kuti atweete kuliLeza. Alimwi bakamujeya mumubili pesi wakabusigwa muMuuya, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />oomo mwakayinka kuyokambawuka kumyuuya ilimuntolongo, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />eeyo itakwe yakaswiilizya chiindi, aawo luzyalo lwaLeza nilwakali bapede mweenya mumazuba aNowa, muchiindi nikwakali kuyakwa bwaato. Oomo bache, chaamba kuti, balimusanu abatatu, bakafutulwa mukwiinda muzambangulwe. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Lubbapatizyo oolo, lwendelana acheechi, lino lulamufutula, peepe mbuli kugwisya tyombe kuzwa kumubili pesi mbuli kulikumbilila kuliLeza kumuyeeyo ululeme, mukwiinda mububuke bwaJesu Kkirisitu, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />ooyo wakayinka kujulu alimwi ulikuluboko lwalulyo lwaLeza. Baangelo, abeendelezi anguzu zilimunsi lyakwe.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Buumi Busandukide</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Nkikaako mbukunga Kkirisitu wakapenzegwa mumubili, ngamube amuyeeyo uliboobo alanu, nkaambo kufumbwa upenzegwa mumubili tachili muchibi pe, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />kuchitila kuti bakapone kwachiindi choonse mumubili kutali aziyandisyo zyamubili pe pesi akuyanda kwaLeza. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Amuleke chiindi eecho chakayinda chijinke chakuchita eezyo batazi Leza nzibachita, kabapona muzisusi, busofwazi, bukolwi, bwaanka, mapobwe ataluleme, akukomba mizimu munzila zisesemya. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Baliikugamba kuti lino tamuchili aamwi pe mukupona kwabo mubuumi bwabo oobo butaluleme, mpawo bamujata bubi, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />pesi bayoovwila kuli ooyo ulibambilide kuyoobeteka bawumi abafu. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Nkaambo nchiichicho ijwi nchilyakakambawukwa nikuba kubafu, nikuba kuti babetekwa mumubili mbuli bantu, ngabayoopona mumuuya mbuli Leza.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babanzi Babotu BaZipo ZyaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Nkikaako mamanino azintu zyoonse ali afwiifwi, ngamuchenjele alimwi mubatame ankaambo kankombyo zyanu. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Atala azyoonse ngamujatisye chakutakatala luyando lwanu kuli umwi awumwi, mbukunga luyando luvumba zibi zyiingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ngamuchitilane kabotu kakutakwe kunyontooka kuli umwi awumwi. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Mbuli awumwi mbwakatambula chipo, ngamubelesezyane mububotu kuli umwi awumwi, mbuli babanzi babotu baluzyalo lusiyenesiyene lwaLeza. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Kufumbwa waambula, abe mbuli umwi waambula majwi aLeza, kufumbwa ukutawuka mulimu, ngabe mbuli umwi ukutawuka anguzu zizwa kuliLeza, kuchitila kuti mulizyoonse Leza alumbayizigwe mukwiinda muli Jesu Kkirisitu. Kulinguwe bulemu abweendelezi bwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzi Amukombi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Nimuyandwa, mutagambwi kumasukusyo ayoosya aza kulindinywe kuti mweezegwe, mbuli kuti kuli chimwi chintu chiyoosya chiliikuchitika kulindinywe. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Pesi ngamubotelwe nimwabilana mukupenzegwa kwaKkirisitu, kuchitila kuti anywebo mukabotelwe mpawo mukakondwe eelyo bulemu bwakwe bwayubununwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Kuti mwatukilwa nkaambo kazina lyaKkirisitu mulilongezedwe, nkaambo Muuya wabulemu awaLeza uli alindinywe. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Pesi kutabi umwi upengana mbuli mujayi, nikuba sikubba, nikuba sikubisya, nikuba sikusunda, <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />anukuti umwi wapenzegwa mbuli munaKkirisitu tayelede kuba abweeme, pesi ansi azina eelyo ngamumuleke alumbayizye Leza.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Nkaambo chiindi chasika lino chalubeta lutaanzi muŋanda yaLeza, alimwi kuti kalutalika andiswe, ayooba biyeni mamanino abaabo bataswiilizyi makani mabotu aLeza? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Alimwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Kuti kakuli buyumuyumu kumusalali kuti avunwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">kuyooba biyeni kuli utakombi asizibi?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Nkikaako aabo bapenzegwa mukwiinda mukuyanda kwaLeza ngabachite kabotu alimwi babikke myuuya yabo kuMulengi usyomekede.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">BuTanga BwaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Aboobo ndakumbila baalu bali akati kanu, mbuli umwi wabaalu akamboni wakupenzegwa kwaKkirisitu alubo mbuli simulimunyina mubulemu oobo buyooyubununwa. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Mweembele butanga bwaLeza ooyo nguumulimu wanu. Muzichite peepe achanguzu pesi akuyanda kwaLeza, peepe nkaambo kampindu italuleme pesi achiyandisyo chakuwutawuka. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Peepe kubapa mukuli aabo mbimweendelezya pesi mube zitondeezyo kubutanga. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Alimwi kuti Mweembeli mupati waakuliboniya muyoojana musini utakulumpali pe wabulemu.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Mbumbubo inywe nibakubusi amulibombye kubaalu. Ngamulisamike, moonse, akulibombya kuli umwi awumwi, nkaambo, “Leza ulabakazya balisumpula, pesi upa luzyalo kuli balibombya.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Nkikaako ngamulifwiinsye munsi aluboko lwaLeza ugambya, kuchitila kuti muchiindi cheelede akamusumpule. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Amupe mikuli yanu yoonse kulinguwe, nkaambo ulamulemutuzya.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Ngamube babeteme, akuchenjela. Sinkondonyokwe Sikuchenga uleendenda mbuli mulavu uvuluma, kayanduula umwi ngwatakanke. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ngamumukazye, ngamuzyandamane mulusyomo lwanu, kamuzi kuti kupenzegwa kukozyene nkumwakalaako kulayandikana kuli babunyoko munyika yoonse. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Alimwi nimutamane kupenzegwa kwachiindi chiniini biyo, Leza waluzyalo loonse, ooyo wakamwiita kubulemu bwakwe butamani muliKkirisitu, we lwakwe uyoomubukulusya, uyomuzyandaminisya, akumuyaka, akumusimya. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kulinguwe ngakube bweendelezi kwalyoonse alyoonse. Ameni.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">KuJuzya Kwakumamanino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Alugwasyo lwaSilivanasi, mukwesu usyomekede mbuli mbundimwaamba, ndamulembela mubufwiifwi, kandimusungwazya akwaamba bukamboni bwakuti oolu nduzyalo lwakasimpe lwaLeza, amwiimikile nji mulindulo.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Eelyo mbungano ilikuBbabbiloni, eeyo mbuboobo yakasalwa, ilamujuzya, alakwe mwana wangu mulombe Makko. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Ngamujuzyane akujuzyaniya kwabunyina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Luumuno lube andinywe moonse nimuli muliKkirisitu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>